The inference model follows the architecture used to produce this release.
The packaged checkpoint and test features were generated by the seed-0
Amazon-1435 experiment. Four visual examples and the pipeline figure are
included in this release.

OpenAI CLIP ViT-B/32 was used upstream to create the bundled features;
its model weights are not included in this release.
